# Two Colab notebooks can append to these append-only logs around the same
# time (e.g. 01 and 02 both write CHECKPOINT_HISTORY.md; 02 and 03 both
# write RESULTS.md). A plain rebase on two end-of-file appends conflicts
# even though both additions are wanted -- `union` keeps both sides' new
# lines instead of asking a human to pick one, which is correct for a
# pure append log (never used for a file anyone hand-edits/reorders).
docs/CHECKPOINT_HISTORY.md merge=union
docs/RESULTS.md merge=union
